# Timestamped run artefacts.
#
# `measure.cjs` writes two files per run: a dated `perf-baseline-<label>-<stamp>.json` AND
# `latest.json`. The dated ones accumulate on every run and are exact duplicates of the `latest.json`
# written beside them, so they are ignored. Everything curated stays tracked:
#
#   reports/latest.json                     the CDP baseline (before)
#   reports-after/latest.json               the CDP run after the optimisations
#   reports-after/isolate-animation.json    the animated-vs-static isolation experiment
#   reports/ab-codesplit.json               the A/B against the code-split prototype
#   reports/lighthouse-mobile-default.json  the Lighthouse 12.6.1 mobile baseline
#
# `ab-aurora.cjs` also writes two screenshots here; they are regenerable and are not tracked.
perf-baseline-*.json
aurora-*.png
